posts.text:
A moment I could never have even dreamt of…being inside the @WhiteHouse press briefing room and getting the opportunity to ask Press Secretary @karolineleavitt a question about a topic that is near & dear to my heart…a topic for which I and too many others have received so much unwarranted hate.  But in the end, good wins!!! And that’s exactly what happened yesterday, thanks to @POTUS!! Forever grateful for for this opportunity 🙏🏽
#savewomenssports 

@mahaaction
